{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_C54165BF","title":"Marcelle's Back for More","entry":"Dlg_C54165BF::entry","exit":"Dlg_C54165BF::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_E1926D96","articyId":"72057611217950800","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"I must congratulate you on sourcing this rat meat. Fresh, toothsome, juicy as the latest Nets gossip and twice as spicy.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I must congratulate you on sourcing this rat meat. Fresh, toothsome, juicy as the latest Nets gossip and twice as spicy.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":775.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22739","byteOffset":16487232,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_E0B3B33F","articyId":"72057611217950829","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Guilty as charged. But please, don’t treat me any differently. I am here to eat, like everyone.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Guilty as charged. But please, don’t treat me any differently. I am here to eat, like everyone.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31034","byteOffset":19622848,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_B97C0A6E","articyId":"72057611217950844","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Food is about giving, not accumulating. All I want is for people to eat and be happy.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Food is about giving, not accumulating. All I want is for people to eat and be happy.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1999.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37144","byteOffset":28393776,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_77F06BDF","articyId":"72057611217950870","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"I don’t think you understand. You are one of this city’s beating hearts. You have a responsibility to keep the blood flowing as best you can, even when people try to bleed you dry.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don’t think you understand. You are one of this city’s beating hearts. You have a responsibility to keep the blood flowing as best you can, even when people try to bleed you dry.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36436","byteOffset":28129176,"byteLength":528}},{"id":"DFr_3424C319","articyId":"72057611217950877","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"True. But what you do is more important than money. You are one of this city’s beating hearts. You have a responsibility to keep the blood flowing as best you can, even when people try to bleed you dry.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"True. But what you do is more important than money. You are one of this city’s beating hearts. You have a responsibility to keep the blood flowing as best you can, even when people try to bleed you dry.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2587.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29426","byteOffset":19011928,"byteLength":548}},{"id":"DFr_5CEA5385","articyId":"72057611217950899","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"If you want to attract customers, you must be bold, daring, but most of all kind. That’s why people came here when Thaddeus was in charge. They felt at home.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you want to attract customers, you must be bold, daring, but most of all kind. That’s why people came here when Thaddeus was in charge. They felt at home.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30317","byteOffset":19349848,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_5155B41F","articyId":"72057611217950919","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"I thought I tasted a background tang of greed. Be careful how much you use. It sticks in the throat.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I thought I tasted a background tang of greed. Be careful how much you use. It sticks in the throat.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3750.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48937","byteOffset":32854544,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_826A14E4","articyId":"72057611217950947","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Make sure you have a broth on the menu. We all need comfort from time to time.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Make sure you have a broth on the menu. We all need comfort from time to time.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29114","byteOffset":18894904,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_6CDB4A75","articyId":"72057611217950821","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I’m glad you like it. Especially since you're a critic.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I’m glad you like it. Especially since you're a critic.","TextSheVersion":"I’m glad you like it. Especially since you're a critic.","TextTheyVersion":"I’m glad you like it. Especially since you're a critic."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1100.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27523","byteOffset":18293624,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_E15E47CB","articyId":"72057611217950837","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"But you could help my business.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But you could help my business.","TextSheVersion":"But you could help my business.","TextTheyVersion":"But you could help my business."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1712.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43088","byteOffset":30630480,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_0AA30C09","articyId":"72057611217950851","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So do I, but that requires Lims.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So do I, but that requires Lims.","TextSheVersion":"So do I, but that requires Lims.","TextTheyVersion":"So do I, but that requires Lims."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2300.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32962","byteOffset":20355376,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_1696264A","articyId":"72057611217950858","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What would it cost for a good word in one of your reviews?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What would it cost for a good word in one of your reviews?","TextSheVersion":"What would it cost for a good word in one of your reviews?","TextTheyVersion":"What would it cost for a good word in one of your reviews?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2125.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30658","byteOffset":19478808,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_F0B81F93","articyId":"72057611217950884","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Plenty of people doing that.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Plenty of people doing that.","TextSheVersion":"Plenty of people doing that.","TextTheyVersion":"Plenty of people doing that."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29082","byteOffset":18882912,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_23090DF9","articyId":"72057611217950890","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And if you gave me a good review...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And if you gave me a good review...","TextSheVersion":"And if you gave me a good review...","TextTheyVersion":"And if you gave me a good review..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22540","byteOffset":16413624,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_72822F9B","articyId":"72057611217950940","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How do I make people feel at home?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How do I make people feel at home?","TextSheVersion":"How do I make people feel at home?","TextTheyVersion":"How do I m